 PLAYERS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Squad, Your Rules: Play 1v1, 4v4, 1v7, or any combination you can imagine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the Zone to Win: Forget traditional kills \u2013 it's all about controlling the zone. Wield your teleporting boomerang hammer to throw, recall, and warp around the arena!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Couch/Local and Online Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-platform</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 interactive, absurd arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from 12 messed-up Outcasts trapped in the Zone. What could possibly go wrong? (Everything.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal Mayhem Guaranteed</p></li></ul>","developers":["Cable Nest"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270900/header.jpg?t=1770658156","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 Cable Nest","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Zen 2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RDNA 2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3270900/1113144